  "notes": "## What's Changed\n\n### Features\n\n- **Added an optional API key for the engine API** in Settings › Service: once set, the engine answers only requests that carry it, and agents launched from Apps get it automatically. Needs engine 0.2.0 or later (update it in Settings)\n- Added GGUF support for some model families with engine 0.2.0 or later; the [engine 0.2.0 release](https://github.com/FlashML-org/FreeToken/releases/tag/v0.2.0) lists which ones\n- Added importing a single GGUF file by dragging it onto the Library\n- Added parameter count and context length for GGUF models in the Library, read from the file itself\n- Added bandwidth calibration per MoE model in the model details, replacing the Detect hardware button in Settings; a MoE model is calibrated automatically on its first launch. Needs engine 0.2.0 or later\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Windows: Fixed reinstalling the engine while a model is loaded failing with \"Access is denied\" and leaving the engine unusable",
